@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
hide empty description

[*] --> Stopped
Stopped --> Opening : evento de apertura
Stopped --> Closing : evento de cierre
Stopped --> Open : solo final de apertura
Stopped --> Closed : solo final de cierre
Closed --> Opening : evento de apertura
Open --> Closing : evento de cierre
Opening --> Open : final de apertura visto
Closing --> Closed : final de cierre visto
Opening --> WaitClose : evento de cierre
Closing --> WaitOpen : evento de apertura
WaitOpen --> Opening : transcurridos 2 s
WaitClose --> Closing : transcurridos 2 s
WaitOpen --> WaitClose : evento de cierre
WaitClose --> WaitOpen : evento de apertura
WaitOpen --> Open : final de apertura visto
WaitClose --> Closed : final de cierre visto
SensorConflict --> Open : solo final de apertura
SensorConflict --> Closed : solo final de cierre
SensorConflict --> Stopped : ningún final

state Opening : contactor de apertura ON
state Closing : contactor de cierre ON

note as N
Se comprueba primero, desde cualquier estado:
1. permiso o posición no disponible -> Stopped
2. ambos finales en true -> SensorConflict
3. STOP/sobrecarga perdido o ambas
   solicitudes pulsadas -> Stopped
   (no desde SensorConflict)
end note
@enduml
